{"title":"Iron Legs","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 7)</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 7 <span class=\"muted\">(359 XP)</span> from 6× <a href=\"#/item/iron-bar\">Iron Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip on q-all\" href=\"#/item/iron-legs\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/iron-legs?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/iron-legs?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/iron-legs?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/iron-legs?q=ordinary\">Ordinary</a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/iron-legs?q=good\">Good</a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/iron-legs?q=excellent\">Excellent</a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/iron-legs?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/iron-legs?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"iron-legs\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"titan\">Titan</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"camel\">Camel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"weasel\">Weasel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"leopard\">Leopard</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"sage\">Sage</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"mage\">Mage</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Protection comes from the armor of all five pieces together, up to 75%.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>A full set of it protects</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/iron-legs?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/a22f5bc4d5c388d24901.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>0.8 armor · 0.3 magic defense</td><td>11% blows · 4% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/iron-legs?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/a22f5bc4d5c388d24901.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td>0.9 armor · 0.3 magic defense</td><td>13% blows · 5% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/iron-legs?q=shoddy\" title=\"Show it at Shoddy\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-shoddy\" src=\"data/img/a22f5bc4d5c388d24901.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></td><td>-10%</td><td>1 armor · 0.4 magic defense</td><td>14% blows · 5% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/iron-legs?q=ordinary\" title=\"Show it at Ordinary\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/a22f5bc4d5c388d24901.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></td><td>0%</td><td>1.1 armor · 0.4 magic defense</td><td>15% blows · 6% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/iron-legs?q=good\" title=\"Show it at Good\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/a22f5bc4d5c388d24901.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></td><td>+10%</td><td>1.2 armor · 0.4 magic defense</td><td>17% blows · 6% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/iron-legs?q=excellent\" title=\"Show it at Excellent\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/a22f5bc4d5c388d24901.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></td><td>+22%</td><td>1.3 armor · 0.5 magic defense</td><td>18% blows · 7% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/iron-legs?q=superior\" title=\"Show it at Superior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-superior\" src=\"data/img/a22f5bc4d5c388d24901.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></td><td>+30%</td><td>1.4 armor · 0.5 magic defense</td><td>19% blows · 7% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/iron-legs?q=flawless\" title=\"Show it at Flawless\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/a22f5bc4d5c388d24901.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></td><td>+38%</td><td>1.5 armor · 0.6 magic defense</td><td>20% blows · 8% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <h2>Getting each quality</h2>\n      <p><b>Crafting</b> (Armor Smithing 7): the higher above 7 you are, the better the odds, up to +30. <a href=\"#/calc-quality\" data-qe=\"iron-legs\">Plan it on Quality &amp; enchanting</a></p>\n        <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table\"><thead><tr><th>Your level</th><th><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>7 <span class=\"muted\">(+0)</span></td><td>1.5%</td><td>4.0%</td><td>19.1%</td><td>56.2%</td><td>16.2%</td><td>2.9%</td><td>0.2%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>12 <span class=\"muted\">(+5)</span></td><td>0.5%</td><td>2.4%</td><td>14.2%</td><td>55.7%</td><td>21.4%</td><td>5.1%</td><td>0.7%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>17 <span class=\"muted\">(+10)</span></td><td>0.1%</td><td>1.2%</td><td>10.0%</td><td>52.7%</td><td>26.4%</td><td>7.8%</td><td>1.7%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>22 <span class=\"muted\">(+15)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.4%</td><td>6.6%</td><td>47.5%</td><td>30.8%</td><td>11.1%</td><td>3.5%</td><td>0.1%</td></tr><tr><td>27 <span class=\"muted\">(+20)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.1%</td><td>3.9%</td><td>40.8%</td><td>33.7%</td><td>15.1%</td><td>5.9%</td><td>0.6%</td></tr><tr><td>30 <span class=\"muted\">(+23)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>2.8%</td><td>36.3%</td><td>34.5%</td><td>17.5%</td><td>7.8%</td><td>1.2%</td></tr><tr><td>32 <span class=\"muted\">(+25)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>2.0%</td><td>33.3%</td><td>35.0%</td><td>19.1%</td><td>9.0%</td><td>1.6%</td></tr><tr><td>37 <span class=\"muted\">(+30)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.8%</td><td>25.7%</td><td>34.7%</td><td>22.7%</td><td>12.8%</td><td>3.3%</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <p><b>Monster drops</b>: ordinary monsters and chests give at most Excellent; elites give only Excellent, Superior or Flawless (official guide).</p>\n      <p class=\"muted\">No drops of it recorded yet.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/silver-legs\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/08ecaf2ee25350d177fd.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Legs</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/gold-legs\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/cfeb933f2442526a5e58.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Legs</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/titanium-legs\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/4e6f73bfebe5438ee961.svg\" alt=\"\">Titanium Legs</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/thak-legs\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/db2d18dfb60dcc393e56.svg\" alt=\"\">Thak Legs</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/it